+      "rationale": "The exact loop-summary transition is first proved as the AUX-SPEC claim against MPY-VERIFICATION, which excludes this rule, before prove.sh compiles MPY-VERIFICATION-LEMMA and reuses the rule for MAIN-SPEC."
